  "ingredients": [
    "1.25 pounds round steak, cut into small pieces",
    "1 cup apple cider",
    "4 Granny Smith apples - peeled, cored and finely diced",
    "2.5 cups dried currants",
    "2.5 cups raisins",
    "1 (16 ounce) jar sour cherry preserves",
    "1.3333333730698 cups white sugar",
    "0.5 pound chopped candied mixed fruit peel",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "1 teaspoon ground ginger",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cloves",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1 (16 ounce) can pitted sour cherries, drained with liquid reserved",
    "1 recipe pastry for a 9 inch double crust pie",
    "2 tablespoons heavy cream",
    "sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine steak and cider in a Dutch oven. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to a simmer. Cover and cook until steak is tender, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ao6KbI7_-540C4vqCetbYezsr7g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22621-old-time-mincemeat-pie-VAT-step-01-06326c5827e346cd872f3a6908ae3bcb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22621/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove steak to a cutting board; coarsely chop, then return to the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wr-suUtsafAZI5IVFSmHhNYv0sA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22621-old-time-mincemeat-pie-VAT-step-02-37356e3e83a54041b7f663aefd717e5d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22621/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in apples, currants, raisins, cherry preserves, 1 1⁄3 cups sugar, mixed fruit peel, and butter. Add ginger, cloves, nutmeg, cinnamon, and salt. Simmer, uncovered, over low heat until mixture is very thick, about 1 hour 30 minutes. Stir in cherries and remove from heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bPjfYqxFp73jKVUWdNqsdB8N3hU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22621-old-time-mincemeat-pie-VAT-step-03-f0c32af3f5854e6aa9d656f9ec551356.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22621/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer filling to a container and allow to cool at room temperature. Cover tightly and refrigerate for at least 3 to 4 days before using.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Kokmajas16D2mAX5apgTMOz8lFU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22621-old-time-mincemeat-pie-VAT-step-04-0e1cd6597e29437bac50ac0f0cc17d4b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22621/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line a 9-inch pie dish with 1 pastry crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/axOfTVwA75VwIfUy2f2mg73DyiY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22621-old-time-mincemeat-pie-VAT-step-05-b1455d22ed004e678a650d301420770c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22621/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon filling into crust and cover with second pastry crust. Crimp edges and cut several slits into top pastry. Brush with cream and sprinkle with 1 teaspoon sugar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_Lvz8s6oQA2erd3mJknwgGhui0s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22621-old-time-mincemeat-pie-VAT-step-06-197372eb1c404ac88bbd3c6424eedb0b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22621/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 45 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center of the pie should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uAV_pssCEjk_7vsQ49xWACQr6pw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22621-old-time-mincemeat-pie-VAT-step-07-ddb541f9cab54231980486d6fdefcc51.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22621/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
